  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@pla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811663/youtube_icon_bcbanf.png\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fEsvPsnqJpz\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811736/discord_icon_bg_rp4omx.png\" alt=\"Discord\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fpla_is_me\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761815764/kofi_icon_bg_sy3foi.png\" alt=\"Ko‑fi\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; <a href=\"https://github.com/PlaIsMe\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/dxehc2hn3/image/upload/v1761811682/github_icon_bg_wmtjei.png\" alt=\"Github\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"> </a></p>\n<p style=\"color:#fc0;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center\">⚠️ 需要 EpicFight 最新版本</p>\n<p><strong>EpicFight : Clash Blade</strong> 是源自 Annoying Villagers 1.3 模組的分支模組。它新增了一項被動技能，讓你在揮舞武器時能與來襲的近戰攻擊或投射物進行碰撞，抵消傷害並將目標擊退。此外，此模組也允許所有其他 EpicFight 生物進行碰撞。</p>\n<p>內附設定檔，可讓您將不適合使用「Clash Blade」功能的實體加入黑名單。</p>",
